Comment: THE RUNTIME AND THE STANDARD LIBRARY -- everything the compiler links
 into a program the user writes. tools/strlib/src/* is listed here because it
 is the source of lib/std/core.fi, math.fi, num.fi and str.fi and is inlined
 into them verbatim. lib/rc/rc.fi is a symbolic link to tests/modules/rc.fi,
 which is the real file. bench/tokenizer is MIT so that the GPL-2.0-only
 versus Apache-2.0 question cannot arise for the crates it links.
